  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">International Citizens Service 2015-2021</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This is the third phase of the International Citizenship Service, a volunteering programme for young people aged between 18-25 from across the UK. Each placement will last up to 3 months with volunteers working directly with local organisations on long-term, sustainable development projects focusing on education, health, livelihoods, civic participation or the environment in some of the world&#x2019;s poorest communities. This will build on the success of phase 1 and 2, which has already seen over 20,000 volunteers participate.</narrative>
  </description>
